              "path": [
                "proposition"
              ],
              "revised_value": "Across the accepted Ukraine, Jordan, Taiwan, and Israel assistance propositions, Foushee’s Ukraine, Jordan, and Taiwan choices generally preserved or authorized assistance, while the Israel choice supported a specific $3.3 billion Foreign Military Financing reduction; these accepted inputs therefore do not support a single uniform cross-country assistance position."
            },
            {
